    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The M-451 Firestorm projects a sustained stream of superheated incendiary gel across a short range cone. Originally designed for burning through bulkheads in derelict station salvage operations, it was repurposed as a combat weapon when salvagers discovered its effectiveness against Husks and other Reaper-derived infantry. The fuel tank limits engagement duration, but within those constraints it is capable of clearing a room faster than any conventional weapon.</p>"
